    <briefdescription>
<para>Opaque handle to an immutable segment returned by <computeroutput><ref refid="classpaimon_1_1_realtime_store_1afdddb3cb41e8bfb019f1100cd94fefa8" kindref="member">RealtimeStore::SealForCommit</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
